          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #1 WORKBOOK",
            "text": "<h3><strong>FREE Hard Copy Program Workbook Shipped to Your Door</strong></h3><p>Receive a copy of the third edition printed workbook shipped to your door, no matter where you are in the world. This workbook is a guide to help you follow the self-paced lessons with ease and reinforce your learnings.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $159</strong> - Yours Free</p>",
