          }
        },
        "273959c3-5bb7-4f82-8330-669c9628a477": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #7 EXPERT HACKS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>How to Turn Your Big Dreams Into Reality</strong></h3><p>What would you do for your health and wellbeing if you couldn’t fail? Hear from expert Kristina Karlsson on how she turned her dreams into a world-wide movement by focusing on her values and purpose.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $99 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
