          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "BONUS #8 EXPERT HACKS",
            "text": "<h3><strong>How to Create a Healthy Brain and Unlock Your Inner Power</strong></h3><p>Join Jim Kwik as he shares secrets of how he overcame some of the biggest challenges life gave him by learning how to optimize his brain.</p><p><strong>Valued at: $99 </strong>- Yours Free</p>",
