    "testimonials": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonials-0": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>I lost over 4 kilos and over 10cm at the waist! I learned a lot of ways to prepare a yummy, filling meal with easy ingredients and with a bit of effort.</p><p>I now enjoy my relationship with all these beautiful veggies.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Dawn_Cunningham.jpg",
            "author": "Dawn",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "eb8e6586-7771-45c1-868d-aef4fbc266eb": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>Thank you to the team at Food Matters for a fantastic program! This Clean Eating Program is so easy to follow and stick to.</p><p>I loved the audio tips each day expanding our knowledge on healthy choices, and easy recipes to create. I feel vibrant, my energy and head is clear, and my skin looks alive. Your time and expertise are greatly appreciated.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Maree_-_Option_A.jpg",
            "author": "Maree",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "426eeede-fdfd-4b82-8eda-ba2d62d68ac6": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>I resisted an alternative approach for years. I trusted my doctors, and as I was prescribed more & more medication, I felt worse & worse. Watching the ‘Food Matters’ film helped me turn my life around & I’m forever grateful. With this information and community, I have gotten off 6 medications, lost 50 pounds, and cured my chronic fatigue, depression, and anxiety. Thank you for changing my life.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/testimonial-roy.jpg",
            "author": "Roy",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "e12e6b0b-43b4-4723-987f-e7322d904069": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>I have really enjoyed the program. Love the simplicity, the meals are easy to prepare, very tasty and satisfying. I didn’t feel hungry between meals so didn’t make any of the snacks. It has been so easy to follow that I feel happy to simply continue eating this way. Thank you so much for putting such a program together. I would recommend it to anyone.</p>",
            "author": "Monique D",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonials-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>I feel lighter and healthier! The nutrition information is life changing! I am so grateful to be doing this program! By the way, I’m going for another 21 days! Thank you to all at Food Matters for making this possible!</p>",
            "author": "Elisa C",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonials-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>My husband and I have done several food matters programs. We always enjoy them immensely, delicious recipes! Thanks Food Matters for this one ! You are such an inspiration ! Greetings from the Netherlands.</p>",
            "author": "Antoinette B",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "3aec4137-6587-4999-997b-89d7329189bd": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>I started this journey back in April, what a change this has had in my life! I have lost 40 lbs, my diabetes is under control, the latest A1C was down to 8.3 M/MOL from 10.8 (it was probably higher but I was too chicken to get my blood work done). My cholesterol good and bad are almost normal, and my liver enzymes are down as well.<br/>My doctor is blown away, he cannot get over how well I am doing.<br/>I cannot say this enough. Thank you, thank you, thank you, for all you amazing Suppport!!!</p>",
            "author": "Edith P",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "8c3ae9ae-be5a-4f58-b63d-c1ea20ed1974": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>After losing my job during the pandemic, I took the Food Matters Nutrition Certification Program to transition to a new career by following my passion in helping mums create better health for their family. In your program, you not only provided your students with the education, but you’ve also provided us with the community and a way to get paid through your referral program. It feels amazing (yet surreal) to share what I love, make an impact and get paid. Thank you so much James, Laurentine and everyone at the Food Matters Team, you’ve changed my life. I love this program so much that I would share it with everyone I know.</p>",
            "author": "Christy",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "5e453ca9-e30c-4596-bee7-fd2b9cab1bb9": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "testimonial": "<p>Thanks so much for developing and offering this Certification Program. It has been one of the best learning experiences that I have ever had. I’m putting this information into practice on myself and will see where my journey takes me. The Food Matters team is committed to excellence and has developed the most fantastic natural healing program I’ve seen to date. Thank you, thank you, thank you! I look forward to more magnificence from Food Matters!</p>",
            "author": "Kim",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
