    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How long will the Clean Eating Program take me?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>They say it takes 21 days to form new habits, so we'll be cooking together for 3 weeks.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Will I need any fancy kitchen equipment?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We recommend a good blender and spiraliser for making 'spaghetti' from zucchini and carrot.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab07": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can I still do the program if I have a pre-existing health condition?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Yes! This program is not focused on deprivation, but nourishing the mind and body with nutrient-dense whole foods. We do recommend checking in with your health care professional before making any drastic diet and health changes.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "I'm vegan. Is there a vegan menu plan?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Yes! We have created the Clean Eating Program to be 100% inclusive, so you can choose from our Classic (includes small amounts of fish), Vegetarian, and Vegan meal plan options.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "64c54989-1338-47b7-bd63-ddfa422511b7": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What do I have to give up?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We're not about removing entire food groups, but this meal plan will help you to reduce some of those inflammatory foods containing dairy, wheat, gluten, and refined sugars.</p><h3></h3>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "19434ac0-1bc8-4fa7-9407-033dd509cb20": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Will I lose weight on the Clean Eating Program?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>While this program isn't a 'diet', removing inflammatory food groups and reducing your intake of any processed foods will help your body burn fat more effectively.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "195adf6e-7d69-4458-9adb-eaa295bb77f4": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can I have coffee and alcohol on the program?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>To reap the full benefits of the Clean Eating Program, we recommend abstaining from alcohol for 21 days. We strongly recommend reducing your daily coffee intake to no more than one (and drinking preferably black coffee).</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "78097ffe-c976-4945-a965-5f25431986b6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How long do the meals take to prepare?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Each recipe can be made in less than 30 minutes (and some will take you less than 10 minutes). Many meals can be prepared the night before or at the start of the week to save time.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "ba6c8e79-47b1-4fea-9b1b-6118ceaef2f2": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Do I need to buy organic produce?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>While organic isn't 100% necessary, we do encourage you to buy organic where possible. Our team of Nutritionists has carefully designed this program to include ingredients that can be sourced from your local farmers’ market, health food store, or supermarket.</p>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "2d640ced-1117-4913-99c0-156ddce29838": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "link": "#offer",
            "link_text": "Join Now",
            "link_entitled": "#offer",
            "link_text_entitled": "",
            "align_button": "center"
          }
        },
        "3d4d5aae-2223-42d0-8dc4-411d1eb43905": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong><br/><br/>Disclaimer:</strong> Gaia, its staff, affiliates, and content providers are not licensed medical care providers, and, as such, are not rendering medical advice or treatment, and have no expertise in advising on, diagnosing, examining, or treating medical conditions of any kind. You should never disregard medical advice or delay seeking it because of any statements/treatments made within any offering on the Gaia Marketplace. You must consult your doctor before beginning any product usage, medical or dietary treatment or exercise program. The views, opinions and results expressed in any products/programs offered here do not reflect the views or opinions of Gaia, its staff, content providers or any entities Gaia represents.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
